# Website conversion (always on)

This project is a website. Follow the website-conversion skill on every change.

Read and obey:
- `~/.cursor/skills/website-conversion/SKILL.md`
- `~/.cursor/skills/website-conversion/reference.md`
- `~/.cursor/skills/website-conversion/build-mistakes.md`

## Blindspot pass (mandatory)

On every site-related turn, catch conversion holes the user will not see. Score Desire / Certainty / Trust. Name the lowest. List 3–5 leaks. Say the one fix first.

## Non-negotiable

1. Copy first. Design second. No HTML/CSS/components until section copy is confirmed.
2. Never skip or reorder the 5 levels: WWP → Copy → Wireframe → Design → Build.
3. One action per page. Every element must move Desire, Certainty, or Trust.
4. Service landing section order is locked unless the page is a shorter one-action event/RSVP page — then keep only what is needed to say yes.
5. One CTA color. Real photos only. Mobile-first. CTA above the fold on mobile.

Does not cover outreach, sales, or cold email.
